  "description": "FFmpeg 8.1.3's shared libraries for linux-musl-x64, built for decoding plus AAC, MP3 and PCM encoding and common muxers (no video encoders; yadif, fps, aspectralstats and audio filters for FrameReader's AudioFilter the only filters; zlib and dav1d for PNG and AV1 linked in), so ShotDetector decodes and probes in-process: faster and with about half the memory of the ffmpeg executable, with the same results. LGPL-2.1-or-later, as FFmpeg (dav1d: BSD-2-Clause); the build recipe is configure.txt in the package.",
